{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mine Safety</strong> is a retro arcade game where you take on the role of a platform operator in a mining facility. Your job is to control a mobile structure to guide the little miners to the exit elevator \u2014 preferably alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/GIF_001.gif?t=1749687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The mine never stops, and the machinery must stay on at all times. High-speed rotating drills are constantly digging in every direction, posing a deadly threat to the little miners. According to your contract, you're legally allowed to cause only a few workplace accidents. Go over the limit? You're fired!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/GIF_002.gif?t=1749687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work quickly to maximize your bonus pay \u2014 but carefully, as each accident reduces your bonus. This is a game of reflexes, strategy, and high scores. The more efficient you are, the higher you'll climb on the global leaderboard, the friends leaderboard, and your own personal ranking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Claim your spot among the best!</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795670?t=1749687570","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795670?t=1749687570","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/6f05001e2fe092ec2c6a120edb715b6cd7360786/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749687570","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/6f05001e2fe092ec2c6a120edb715b6cd7360786/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749687570","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mine Safety</strong> is a retro arcade game where you take on the role of a platform operator in a mining facility. Your job is to control a mobile structure to guide the little miners to the exit elevator \u2014 preferably alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/GIF_001.gif?t=1749687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The mine never stops, and the machinery must stay on at all times. High-speed rotating drills are constantly digging in every direction, posing a deadly threat to the little miners. According to your contract, you're legally allowed to cause only a few workplace accidents. Go over the limit? You're fired!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/extras/GIF_002.gif?t=1749687570\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work quickly to maximize your bonus pay \u2014 but carefully, as each accident reduces your bonus. This is a game of reflexes, strategy, and high scores. The more efficient you are, the higher you'll climb on the global leaderboard, the friends leaderboard, and your own personal ranking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Claim your spot among the best!</strong> </p>","developers":["Minicactus Games"],"ext_user_account_notice":"MF D P D C S E LTDA ","genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795670/3dbabac8ecdcdd1d2a6ed6008907ac074b53584b/header.jpg?t=1749687570","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"